<div class="modal fade" id="tli-link-file-modal" tabindex="-1"
     data-lookup-url="{{ path('app_file_edit-lookup') }}?articleId={{ ArticleId }}"
     data-create-from-url-url="{{ path('app_file_edit-create_from_url') }}?articleId={{ ArticleId }}"
     data-create-from-upload-url="{{ path('app_file_edit-upload_from_modal') }}?articleId={{ ArticleId }}">

    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>
                    Aggiungi un Download
                </h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body tli-link-file-dropzone">

                <div class="input-group">
                    <input type="text" class="form-control tli-link-file-search-input"
                           placeholder="Cerca un Download, incolla un URL o trascina qui un file">
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-primary tli-link-file-pick" type="button">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-upload"></i> Scegli file...
                    </button>
                </div>
                <input type="file" class="d-none tli-link-file-upload-input">
                <div class="form-text mb-3">
                    Prima di crearne uno nuovo, verifico se il file o l'URL è già su TurboLab.it: un elemento, un Download.
                </div>

                {# what the author is adding: a file or a URL #}
                <div class="tli-link-file-source d-none mb-3 p-2 border rounded bg-body-tertiary d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-up tli-link-file-source-icon"></i>
                    <strong class="tli-link-file-source-name text-break"></strong>
                    <span class="tli-link-file-source-status small text-muted"></span>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close ms-auto tli-link-file-source-clear" title="Annulla"></button>
                </div>

                <div class="tli-link-file-matches d-none mb-3">
                    <div class="alert alert-success mb-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                        <span class="tli-link-file-matches-text"></span> Usa quello:
                    </div>
                    <div class="tli-link-file-matches-list"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="tli-link-file-similar d-none mb-3 p-3 border border-2 border-danger rounded bg-danger-subtle">
                    <p class="mb-2 text-danger-emphasis">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-code-compare"></i>
                        <strong>Download simili</strong>: se il tuo è una nuova versione di uno di questi, sostituiscilo.
                        Se invece è un elemento diverso (una variante: 32/64 bit, per un altro sistema operativo, ...), crea un nuovo Download qui sotto.
                    </p>
                    <div class="tli-link-file-similar-list"></div>
                </div>

                <form class="tli-link-file-create-form d-none mb-3 p-3 border rounded bg-body-tertiary">
                    <h6><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Nuovo Download</h6>
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <label class="form-label small mb-1 tli-link-file-create-title-label"></label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm tli-link-file-create-title"
                               maxlength="{{ constant('App\\Entity\\Cms\\Article::TITLE_MAX_LENGTH') }}" required>
                        <div class="form-text">
                            💡 Meglio senza numero di versione: quando uscirà la prossima, sostituirai il Download
                            e il titolo resterà valido in tutti gli articoli che lo citano.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2 tli-link-file-create-format-box">
                        <label class="form-label small mb-1">Formato</label>
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm tli-link-file-create-format">
                            <option value="">-- scegli --</option>
                            {% for value, Item in Formats %}
                                <option value="{{ value }}">{% if Item.top %}📌 {% endif %}{{ Item.label }}</option>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm tli-link-file-create-submit">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> Crea e inserisci nell'articolo
                    </button>
                    <div class="tli-link-file-create-error mt-2"></div>
                </form>

                {# search by text: the latest Downloads when the field is empty #}
                <div class="tli-link-file-search-box">
                    <div class="mb-3 small">
                        <div class="form-check form-check-inline me-0">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="tli-link-file-mine-only" name="only-mine" value="1">
                            <label class="form-check-label" for="tli-link-file-mine-only">Inseriti da me</label>
                        </div>
                        <span class="border-start mx-2"></span>
                        <span class="me-2">Ordina per:</span>
                        <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="file-sort" id="tli-link-file-sort-relevance" value="relevance">
                            <label class="form-check-label" for="tli-link-file-sort-relevance">Rilevanza</label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="file-sort" id="tli-link-file-sort-date" value="date" checked>
                            <label class="form-check-label" for="tli-link-file-sort-date">Data</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="tli-link-file-results"></div>

                    <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-0">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
                        Non c'è? Incolla l'URL nel campo qui sopra, oppure scegli o trascina qui il file: lo creerai dopo la verifica.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
